      "html": "<ul><li>Scientific name: Corydoras(ln6) longipinnis Knaack, 2007</li><li>Common names: CW003, Long-finned Cory, Langfinnet Pansermalle (Denmark)</li><li>Size: 61 mm (2.4 in) SL</li><li>Etymology: the specific epithet refers to its long fins (pinnis = fin).</li><li>IUCN Red List: Not Evaluated</li></ul>"
